{"suttaId":"tha-ap30","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[3041,3075],"vripara":"169"},"segments":{"tha-ap30:0.3":"Uttiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap30:1.1":"“Candabhāgānadītīre, susumāro ahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap30:1.3":"Sagocarappasutohaṃ [sabhojanapasutāhaṃ (syā. ka.)], nadītitthaṃ agacchahaṃ.","tha-ap30:2.1":"“Siddhattho tamhi samaye, sayambhū aggapuggalo;","tha-ap30:2.3":"Nadiṃ taritukāmo so, nadītitthaṃ upāgami.","tha-ap30:3.1":"“Upāgate ca [upāgatamhi (syā. ka.)] sambuddhe, ahampi tatthupāgamiṃ;","tha-ap30:3.3":"Upagantvāna sambuddhaṃ, imaṃ vācaṃ udīrayiṃ.","tha-ap30:4.1":"“‘Abhirūha mahāvīra, tāressāmi ahaṃ tuvaṃ;","tha-ap30:4.3":"Pettikaṃ visayaṃ mayhaṃ, anukampa mahāmuni’.","tha-ap30:5.1":"“Mama uggajjanaṃ sutvā, abhirūhi mahāmuni;","tha-ap30:5.3":"Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittena, tāresiṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap30:6.1":"“Nadiyā pārime tīre, siddhattho lokanāyako;","tha-ap30:6.3":"Assāsesi mamaṃ tattha, amataṃ pāpuṇissasi.","tha-ap30:7.1":"“Tamhā kāyā cavitvāna, devalokaṃ āgacchahaṃ;","tha-ap30:7.3":"Dibbasukhaṃ anubhaviṃ, accharāhi purakkhato.","tha-ap30:8.1":"“Sattakkhattuñca devindo, devarajjamakāsahaṃ;","tha-ap30:8.3":"Tīṇikkhattuṃ cakkavattī, mahiyā issaro ahuṃ.","tha-ap30:9.1":"“Vivekamanuyuttohaṃ, nipako ca susaṃvuto;","tha-ap30:9.3":"Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, sammāsambuddhasāsane.","tha-ap30:10.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, tāresiṃ yaṃ narāsabhaṃ;","tha-ap30:10.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, taraṇāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap30:11.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap30:11.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap30:12.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā uttiyo [uttiriyo (sī.)] thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap30:13.1":"Uttiyattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2377,"to":2380,"paras":[{"para":2377,"vripara":"169","refs":["tha-ap30:1"],"lines":["Evaṃ so katasambhārānurūpena pattaarahattaphalo attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>candabhāgānadītīre</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>candabhāgānadītīre</b>ti parisuddhapaṇḍarapulinatalehi ca pabhāsampannapasannamadhurodakaparipuṇṇatāya ca candappabhākiraṇasassirīkābhā nadamānā saddaṃ kurumānā gacchatīti candabhāgānadī, tassā candabhāgānadiyā tīre susumāro ahosinti sambandho.","Tattha <b>susumāro</b>ti khuddakamacchagumbe khaṇḍākhaṇḍikaṃ karonto māretīti susumāro, caṇḍamaccho kumbhīloti attho.","<b>Sabhojanapasutohan</b>ti ahaṃ sabhojane sakagocare pasuto byāvaṭo.","<b>Nadītitthaṃ agacchahan</b>ti bhagavato āgamanakāle ahaṃ nadītitthaṃ agacchiṃ pattomhi."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap30:1"],["tha-ap30:1"],["tha-ap30:1"],["tha-ap30:1"],["tha-ap30:1"]]},{"para":2378,"vripara":"170","refs":["tha-ap30:2"],"lines":["<b>Siddhattho tamhi samaye</b>ti tasmiṃ mama titthagamanakāle siddhattho bhagavā aggapuggalo sabbasattesu jeṭṭho seṭṭho <b>sayambhū</b> sayameva bhūto jāto buddhabhūto so bhagavā nadiṃ taritukāmo nadītīraṃ upāgami."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap30:2"]]},{"para":2379,"vripara":"172","refs":["tha-ap30:4"],"lines":["<b>Pettikaṃ visayaṃ mayhan</b>ti mayhaṃ pitupitāmahādīhi paramparānītaṃ, yadidaṃ sampattasampattamahānubhāvānaṃ taraṇanti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap30:4"]]},{"para":2380,"vripara":"173","refs":["tha-ap30:5"],"lines":["<b>Mama uggajjanaṃ sutvā</b>ti mayhaṃ uggajjanaṃ ārādhanaṃ sutvā mahāmuni bhagavā abhiruhīti sambandho.","Sesaṃ uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap30:5"],["tha-ap30:5"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap30:1.1","candabhāgānadītīre",0,0],["tha-ap30:1.1","candabhāgānadītīre",0,1],["tha-ap30:1.1","susumāro",0,2],["tha-ap30:1.3","nadītitthaṃ agacchahaṃ",0,4],["tha-ap30:2.1","sayambhū",1,0],["tha-ap30:2.1","siddhattho tamhi samaye",1,0],["tha-ap30:4.3","pettikaṃ visayaṃ mayhaṃ",2,0],["tha-ap30:5.1","mama uggajjanaṃ sutvā",3,0]]},"tika":null}
